n and Its Impacts","78","1"]},{"_type":"tableRow","_key":"45x2xt4dz1e","cells":["Dr Umar Ali Bukar","Disaster Management and Resilience","626","2"]},{"_type":"tableRow","_key":"4d4kxeuy0hw","cells":["Mrs Alice Njolke Mafe","Probiotics and Fermented Foods","674","2"]},{"_type":"tableRow","_key":"icn4s3txw1h","cells":["Dr Buhari Shehu Miapyen","Religion, Society, and Development","819","14"]},{"_type":"tableRow","_key":"6rv702nlfbu","cells":["Dr Vincent Nduka Ojeh","Oil, Gas, and Environmental Issues","374","47"]}]},{"_type":"note","_key":"0c8sfo716wn6","tone":"pending","text":"Information pending: the complete count of TSU publications tagged to Africa-priority themes, linked to Scopus/Web of Science records, from a Scopus affiliation export."}],"sourceNotes":["Publications: articles verified for TSU’s International Collaboration and TETFund-Supported Research pages; themes assigned by subject.","Researcher fields: Scholarly Index Top1000 Scholars, 2026 edition (public beta)."],"lastUpdatedNote":"October 2026"}
{"_id":"statisticIndicator-institutional-ai-policy","_type":"statisticIndicator","title":"Institutional AI Policy","slug":{"_type":"slug","current":"institutional-ai-policy"},"indicatorNumber":22,"order":10,"summary":"TSU’s policy on the responsible and ethical use of artificial intelligence, including generative AI, in teaching, assessment, research and administration, approved by Senate.","stats":[{"value":"Approved","label":"By Senate, version 1.0"},{"value":"21","label":"Policy sections, plus 4 appendices"},{"value":"2 years","label":"Maximum interval between reviews"}],"sections":[{"_type":"factsTable","_key":"policy-at-a-glance","heading":"Policy at a Glance","columns":["Item","Details"],"rows":[{"_type":"tableRow","_key":"9ddpnb2xdz","cells":["Policy title","Responsible and Ethical Use of Artificial Intelligence Policy"]},{"_type":"tableRow","_key":"vhkahiif5j","cells":["Status","Approved by Senate, version 1.0"]},{"_type":"tableRow","_key":"k8x9wjjak59","cells":["Applies to","All students, academic and non-teaching staff, researchers, visiting scholars, contractors and consultants, and all AI systems used for University purposes"]},{"_type":"tableRow","_key":"m9jbsgaiju","cells":["Approving body","Senate, with oversight by the Governing Council"]},{"_type":"tableRow","_key":"ihy7jw5svxj","cells":["Review","At least every two years, or sooner if technology, law or regulation changes"]}]},{"_type":"factsTable","_key":"what-the-policy-covers","heading":"What the Policy Covers","columns":["Area","Where in the policy"],"rows":[{"_type":"tableRow","_key":"x5ifdrojq","cells":["Teaching and learning","Section 7"]},{"_type":"tableRow","_key":"80b4w5bxqwp","cells":["Assessment and examinations","Section 8 and Appendix A"]},{"_type":"tableRow","_key":"6nwivckegxy","cells":["Research","Section 9"]},{"_type":"tableRow","_key":"627c02e95qe","cells":["Academic integrity and plagiarism","Sections 6, 15, 18 and 19"]},{"_type":"tableRow","_key":"ds2wtbzxmag","cells":["Data protection and privacy","Section 11"]},{"_type":"tableRow","_key":"366z6xjiu8v","cells":["Responsible and ethical AI use","Sections 5, 12, 13 and 14"]}]},{"_type":"factsTable","_key":"key-provisions","heading":"Key Provisions","columns":["Principle","What it means"],"rows":[{"_type":"tableRow","_key":"swcyo48efa","cells":["Human responsibility","AI supports human decisions but never replaces accountable human judgement on grades, admissions, discipline, employment or finance."]},{"_type":"tableRow","_key":"2wvkgp4e0xm","cells":["Clear rules for every assessment","Each assessment is classed as A (AI prohibited), B (restricted), C (permitted) or D (required), and students are told in advance."]},{"_type":"tableRow","_key":"qrx9h4l7q3","cells":["Disclosure","Students, staff and researchers declare material AI use, using the model declarations in the policy."]},{"_type":"tableRow","_key":"03ylq14rd0nn","cells":["Research integrity","AI must not fabricate data, references or results, and cannot be listed as an author."]},{"_type":"tableRow","_key":"hnrdntn0bin","cells":["Data protection","Personal data, student records, examination material and unpublished research must not be entered into unapproved AI tools."]},{"_type":"tableRow","_key":"0cm4qlbxu70o","cells":["Fair process","An AI-detector score alone is never treated as proof of misconduct, and affected people can ask for human review."]},{"_type":"tableRow","_key":"568uifgazre","cells":["Fairness and access","Users check AI output for bias, and the University will work to reduce unequal access to paid AI tools."]},{"_type":"tableRow","_key":"agqhkjaavbc","cells":["AI literacy","Regular training for students and staff on verification, citation, privacy, bias, copyright and assessment design."]}]},{"_type":"factsTable","_key":"who-is-responsible","heading":"Who Is Responsible","columns":["Office","Role under the policy"],"rows":[{"_type":"tableRow","_key":"ffc1jtn77ds","cells":["Governing Council and Senate","Approve and oversee the policy and major amendments"]},{"_type":"tableRow","_key":"g5mqnjqw88p","cells":["Vice-Chancellor and Management","Leadership, resources and risk oversight"]},{"_type":"tableRow","_key":"k636nn8lzyf","cells":["Faculties and departments","Set AI rules for each assessment and promote AI literacy"]},{"_type":"tableRow","_key":"1j6eg4ygglc","cells":["Directorate of ICT/MIS","Secure AI infrastructure, risk assessment and technical guidance"]},{"_type":"tableRow","_key":"eymcaylrwdi","cells":["University Library","Training in information literacy, citation and source checking"]},{"_type":"tableRow","_key":"8zxxe21901s","cells":["Research Directorate and Postgraduate School","AI guidance in research integrity and supervision"]}]},{"_type":"note","_key":"5ratbc25oi6","tone":"info","text":"TSU’s ICT Complex is a 3MTT training centre, and the Faculty of Computing and Artificial Intelligence has NUC approval for three new degrees from 2026/2027: B.Sc. Data Science, B.Sc. Information and Communication Technology and B.Sc. Software Engineering.","linkHref":"/academics","linkLabel":"Explore TSU’s faculties and programmes"}],"sourceNotes":["Taraba State University, Responsible and Ethical Use of Artificial Intelligence Policy, version 1.0 (October 2026).","New programmes: NUC approval letter NUC/AP/S31/VOL.I/310, 1 June 2026. 3MTT: MoU between SAIL Empowerment Foundation and TSU (2025)."],"lastUpdatedNote":"October 2026"}
